r /> If you need it I've also expanded the Locust Host and made a complete list of Aspects and powers to introduce the Shartha in your game. It can be found here: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/148097-shartha-srizaku-the-locust-host\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...he-locust-host</a><br /> <br /> Let me know how things work out and thanks for the appreciation!</div> </div> </div> </div>I think I'll steal that too then!<br /> Was it you who had the idea that after the mutation they could leave the host, and then return to it later? Going back and forth into a swarm being.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/585-seidmadr","name":"Seidmadr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar585_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-13T22:18:14-07:00","id":168639,"title":"","content":"Out of curiousity, have you ever designed or thought about a symbol for these guys? Do you have any suggestions?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-14T08:10:38-07:00","id":168938,"title":"","content":"I'd imagine that this group would use a locust centered on a sheaf of wheat, wings outstretched as if in flight.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_l